// A scripted Transport.
//
// marianoguerra/mcp deliberately has no mock transport -- it keeps its logic
// pure and fakes the byte source instead -- and this module follows that rule
// everywhere it can: the form encoder, the envelope, the paginator and all of
// Block Kit are pure and tested without a transport. This package exists for
// the last mile (the `Client::call` glue) and, more importantly, for consumers
// testing their own Slack app.
import {
  "marianoguerra/slack/api",
  "moonbitlang/core/json",
}
